{"id":"level-up-2026-10-20","name":"2026-10-20 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1601","en":"She continued to persist in her search for the missing letter.","zh":"她继续坚持寻找那封丢失的信。","note":"persist · 坚持； 维持， 保持， 持续 · persist in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1602","en":"The volunteers used a pump to remove water from the basement.","zh":"志愿者们用水泵抽走地下室里的水。","note":"pump · 用泵抽；涌出，奔流；泵， 抽水机 · pump water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1603","en":"Visitors should exercise caution on the uneven steps near the entrance.","zh":"游客在入口附近凹凸不平的台阶上应当小心。","note":"caution · 提醒， 警告；谨慎，小心 · exercise caution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1604","en":"The two villages are only five kilometres apart.","zh":"这两个村庄之间只有五公里。","note":"apart · 相间隔；分离；除去；分离的 · far apart","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1605","en":"I marked the interview date on the kitchen calendar.","zh":"我在厨房的日历上标出了面试日期。","note":"calendar · 日历； 月历； 日程表 · a wall calendar","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1606","en":"He checked his phone compulsively while waiting for the results.","zh":"等待结果时，他忍不住一遍遍查看手机。","note":"compulsively · 强制地； 禁不住地 · check compulsively","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1607","en":"A summer intern helped catalogue the museum's collection of photographs.","zh":"一位暑期实习生帮助编目博物馆的照片藏品。","note":"intern · 拘禁，软禁['Intɜːn]；实习生 · a summer intern","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1608","en":"The novel portrays her righteous anger at the unfair accusation.","zh":"小说描写了她面对不公指控时义愤填膺的样子。","note":"righteous · 正义的， 正直的； 公正的； 正当的 · righteous anger","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1609","en":"Young lambs cavort in the field beside the farmhouse.","zh":"小羊在农舍旁的田野里欢蹦乱跳。","note":"cavort · 欢跃， 跳跃； 嬉戏 · cavort in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1610","en":"Without further evidence, we can only speculate about the cause.","zh":"没有更多证据，我们只能推测原因。","note":"speculate · 推测； 投机 · speculate about","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1611","en":"Her diary records growing disillusionment with life in the capital.","zh":"她的日记记录了她对首都生活日渐破灭的幻想。","note":"disillusionment · 幻灭； 觉醒， 醒悟 · growing disillusionment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1612","en":"We play badminton at the sports centre every Tuesday.","zh":"我们每周二在体育中心打羽毛球。","note":"badminton · 羽毛球 · play badminton","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1613","en":"We must dismantle the tent before packing the equipment.","zh":"收拾装备之前，我们必须先拆掉帐篷。","note":"dismantle · 拆除； 废除， 取消 · dismantle a tent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1614","en":"The children drew a sea monster with enormous green eyes.","zh":"孩子们画了一只有着巨大绿眼睛的海怪。","note":"monster · 怪物； 巨人， 庞然大物 · a sea monster","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1615","en":"Effective teamwork helped us prepare the exhibition in just two days.","zh":"有效的团队合作帮助我们仅用两天就筹备好了展览。","note":"teamwork · 协力合作， 团队合作； 配合 · effective teamwork","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1616","en":"The technician will calibrate the instrument before taking new measurements.","zh":"技术人员会先校准仪器，再进行新的测量。","note":"calibrate · 标定， 划分； 校准刻度 · calibrate an instrument","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1617","en":"The tour will acquaint new students with the campus facilities.","zh":"这次参观会让新生熟悉校园设施。","note":"acquaint · 认识； 熟悉 · acquaint with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1618","en":"An antique dealer offered to examine the old writing desk.","zh":"一位古董商提出可以看看那张旧书桌。","note":"dealer · 商人， 经销商 · an antique dealer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1619","en":"She secured the rolled poster with an elastic band.","zh":"她用一根橡皮筋固定住卷好的海报。","note":"elastic · 有弹性的； · an elastic band","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1620","en":"Volunteers will assist with registration at the entrance to the hall.","zh":"志愿者将在大厅入口协助登记。","note":"assist · 帮助， 援助， 协助 · assist with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1621","en":"Heavy snowfall and consequent delays disrupted our carefully planned journey.","zh":"大雪及其造成的延误打乱了我们精心安排的旅程。","note":"consequent · 作为结果的； 随之发生的 · consequent delays","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1622","en":"The undergraduate course introduces students to basic methods of field research.","zh":"这门本科课程向学生介绍实地研究的基本方法。","note":"undergraduate · 大学本科生， 大学生， 大学肄业生 · an undergraduate course","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1623","en":"The lecture examined research methods used to study antibiotic resistance.","zh":"这场讲座探讨了研究抗生素耐药性所用的方法。","note":"antibiotic · 抗菌的；抗生素，抗菌素 · antibiotic resistance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1624","en":"The old warehouse was converted into commercial property last year.","zh":"这座旧仓库去年被改造成了商业用房。","note":"commercial · 商业的，商品化的，贸易的；商业广告 · commercial property","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1625","en":"The two schools launched a joint project on local history.","zh":"两所学校共同启动了一项当地历史研究项目。","note":"joint · 连接的； 联合的；接头；关节 · a joint project","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1626","en":"The researchers compared plant growth in fresh and saline water.","zh":"研究人员比较了植物在淡水和盐水中的生长情况。","note":"saline · 含盐的，咸的；【医】 盐水 · saline water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1627","en":"Keep the original documents separate from the photocopies.","zh":"把原始文件和复印件分开放。","note":"separate · 使分离， 使分开； 划分， 区分； 分离， 分开； 分居；分离的， 分开的； 不同的， 特别的 · separate from","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1628","en":"He began to stammer when the unexpected question caught him off guard.","zh":"那个意外的问题使他措手不及，他开始结巴起来。","note":"stammer · 结巴， · begin to stammer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1629","en":"We found a comfortable room at a reasonable price.","zh":"我们找到了一间价格合理的舒适房间。","note":"reasonable · 合理的， 有道理的； 通情达理的； 适度的 · a reasonable price","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1630","en":"Several neighbours were willing to help carry the furniture.","zh":"几位邻居愿意帮忙搬家具。","note":"willing · 愿意的， 乐意的 · willing to help","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1631","en":"The drawer contained a haphazard collection of keys and receipts.","zh":"抽屉里杂乱地放着一堆钥匙和收据。","note":"haphazard · 无秩序的， 无计划的， 组织混乱的 · a haphazard collection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1632","en":"The instructions use numbered steps to avoid ambiguity.","zh":"这些说明使用编号步骤，避免含糊不清。","note":"ambiguity · 模棱两可； 不明确 · avoid ambiguity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1633","en":"At first, the missing date seemed a trivial detail.","zh":"起初，缺失的日期似乎只是一个无关紧要的细节。","note":"trivial · 无价值的， 琐屑的； 平庸的， 普通的 · a trivial detail","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1634","en":"The museum's upper floor contains an exhibition of military history.","zh":"博物馆楼上设有一个军事历史展。","note":"military · 军事的；[the ～] 军队 · military history","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1635","en":"The children were reluctant to leave the beach at sunset.","zh":"日落时，孩子们不愿离开海滩。","note":"reluctant · 不情愿的， 勉强的； 难得到的， 难处理的 · reluctant to leave","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1636","en":"They decided to forgo a holiday to finish restoring the house.","zh":"他们决定放弃度假，完成房屋修复工作。","note":"forgo · 放弃， 抛弃； 作罢 · forgo a holiday","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1637","en":"The new ramp will ensure access for visitors using wheelchairs.","zh":"新的坡道将确保轮椅访客可以通行。","note":"ensure · 确保， 保证； 担保； 赋予 · ensure access","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1638","en":"Each living organism interacts with other parts of its environment.","zh":"每个生物体都与环境中的其他部分相互作用。","note":"organism · 生物； 有机体 · a living organism","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1639","en":"The archive contains letters written during an influenza epidemic.","zh":"档案中保存着一次流感流行期间写下的信件。","note":"epidemic · 流行病，传染病 · an influenza epidemic","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1640","en":"Suppose the train is delayed; how else could we travel?","zh":"假设火车晚点了，我们还能怎样出行？","note":"suppose · 假想， 假定， 猜想， 推测； [用于祈使句]假定， 让； [常用于被动语态]期望做， 认为应该做 · suppose that","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1641","en":"Finishing the restoration in six months was a remarkable achievement.","zh":"在六个月内完成修复是一项非凡的成就。","note":"remarkable · 引人注目的， 显著的， 值得注意的； 异常的， 非凡的 · a remarkable achievement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1642","en":"The university chancellor welcomed graduates at the annual ceremony.","zh":"大学校监在年度典礼上欢迎毕业生。","note":"chancellor · 大臣； 总理； 首席法官； 大学校长 · university chancellor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1643","en":"The teacher read an extract from a nineteenth-century travel diary.","zh":"老师朗读了一段十九世纪旅行日记的节选。","note":"extract · 摘录，选段；提出物，精，汁[Ik'strækt]；取出； 提取 · an extract from","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1644","en":"A different arrangement of shelves could solve our storage problem.","zh":"换一种架子的摆放方式，可能就能解决我们的储物问题。","note":"solve · 解答； 解决 · solve a problem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1645","en":"Positive feedback helped bolster her confidence before the final presentation.","zh":"积极的反馈帮助她在最终展示前增强了信心。","note":"bolster · 支持，支撑； · bolster confidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1646","en":"The label provides nutritional information for each serving of soup.","zh":"标签提供了每份汤的营养信息。","note":"nutritional · 营养的， 滋养的； 营养物的， 食物的 · nutritional information","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1647","en":"The coastal region attracts artists because of its unusual light.","zh":"这个沿海地区因其独特的光线而吸引着艺术家。","note":"region · 地区； 范围 · a coastal region","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1648","en":"The frightened child held her father's hand during the storm.","zh":"暴风雨中，受到惊吓的孩子握住父亲的手。","note":"frightened · 受惊的； 受恐吓的 · a frightened child","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1649","en":"Misleading photographs can deceive customers about a product's actual size.","zh":"误导性的照片可能让顾客误判产品的实际尺寸。","note":"deceive · 欺骗， 蒙骗 · deceive customers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:s1650","en":"The new park quickly became popular with the local populace.","zh":"这座新公园很快就受到当地居民的喜爱。","note":"populace · 人口， 全体居民； 平民， 大众 · the local populace","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:w1601","en":"persist","zh":"坚持； 维持， 保持， 持续","note":"英 /pə'sɪst/ · 美 /pɚ'sɪst/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1601-uk-3926c465d8cb.mp3","text":"persist"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1601-us-c29f67a099dd.mp3","text":"persist"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:w1602","en":"pump","zh":"用泵抽；涌出，奔流；泵， 抽水机","note":"英 /pʌmp/ · 美 /pʌmp/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1602-uk-67de32d6fa51.mp3","text":"pump"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1602-us-d2d358eedafa.mp3","text":"pump"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-20:w1603","en":"caution","zh":"提醒， 警告；谨慎，小心","note":"英 /'kɔːʃn/ · 美 /'kɔʃən/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1603-uk-057026fa4c0